4. DATA AND CONNECTIVITY
   The Software does not transmit telemetry to FinOpsly by default. When you
   run a command that analyzes infrastructure (such as `finopsly estimate`),
   the Software sends the Terraform plan data for that run — and no other
   project data — to the FinOpsly FI Pulse API. If AMI enrichment is enabled,
   the Software may also query your local AWS credentials (via AWS EC2
   DescribeImages) to enrich cost estimates; this call is made directly to AWS
   from your machine and is not routed through FinOpsly. Use of the FinOpsly
   API is additionally governed by FinOpsly's Privacy Policy
   (https://finopsly.com/privacy-policy).

